Still 1.2.0. No app lowers your music any more.

Ducking is gone from both phones. On iPhone it could not be turned off and on again mid-call without dropping the Bluetooth output your music was playing on — build 184 stopped background audio for good, and that is fixed by removing it. On Android it worked, and went with it so there is one behaviour rather than two.

So music plays at its own volume through a call, and voices are levelled to carry over it.
